{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13210140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13210140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321014001:1":{"text":"기이한 웨이터! 괜찮나?","source_cn":"奇花！你没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75255478A9E55A75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321014002:1":{"text":"괜, 괜찮습니다... 걱정 끼쳐서 죄송해요...","source_cn":"没、没事……对不起，让各位担心了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10F56BA029D6FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321014003:1":{"text":"무사하면 다행이야...","source_cn":"没出事就好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269A3098C6026422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321014004:1":{"text":"이걸 보면 미스터 티포트도 기이한 웨이터를 꽤 신경 쓰고 있는 것 같네요! 우리 중에 미스터 티포트가 가장 빨리 달려왔잖아요!","source_cn":"这么看来，茶壶先生还是很关心奇花的嘛！我们一路上追过来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEB009011C9AF8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321014005:1":{"text":"맞아요! 미스터 티포트는 달려오느라 얼굴까지 빨개졌어요. 머릿속의 차가 다시 데워진 것 같네요!","source_cn":"是啊，茶壶先生跑得脸都红了，好像连脑袋里的茶都重新热起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B28ADE77B2FD31E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321014006:1":{"text":"미스터 티포트, 감사합니다...","source_cn":"谢谢您，茶壶先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30BB3FFD2D754697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321014007:1":{"text":"고맙다는 소리를 듣기보다는... 오히려 내가 사과해야 하지.","source_cn":"唉，你谢我做什么……应该我向你道歉才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BB5F78A48B34832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321014008:1":{"text":"미안해. 그렇게 너를 질책해서는 안 됐어. 찻잎을 보관하는 것은 내 책임이고, 차에서 쓴맛이 난 것도 내 잘못이야. 채집을 맡은 너와는 아무런 관계가 없지.","source_cn":"对不起，刚才我不该那样训斥你。毕竟保存茶叶是我的职责，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13EF4EA89998347B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321014009:1":{"text":"아니요, 미스터 티포트... 제 잘못이에요.","source_cn":"不是的，茶壶先生……那不是你的错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CDADAA81A531AD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321014010:1":{"text":"며칠 전에 채집한 꽃잎을 꿀에 절이지 않았다는 게 떠올랐어요...","source_cn":"我刚刚才想起来，前几天新摘的那些花瓣，还没来得及蜜渍……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C251F15E82B5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321014011:1":{"text":"꿀에 절여?","source_cn":"蜜渍？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39E0ABF4476E894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321014012:1":{"text":"네. 꽃잎으로 차를 끓이려면 먼저 꿀에 절여야 해요. 그래야 꽃향기를 유지하면서 쓴맛을 없앨 수 있거든요.","source_cn":"是的。只有经过蜜渍的花瓣才能作为茶叶……既能保留花香，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F93AC8453FF840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321014013:1":{"text":"제가 그걸 깜빡했어요. 죄송해요... 제 잘못이에요.","source_cn":"我、我刚刚才想起来……对不起，都是我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15140E2D09F1372D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321014014:1":{"text":"그래서 차에서 쓴맛이 났던 거군요!","source_cn":"原来是这样！难怪前两壶茶喝起来会是苦的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA614AFA72C4CB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321014015:1":{"text":"하지만 나는 그런 작업을 한 적이 없어! 왜 지금까지 꽃잎에서 쓴맛이 나지 않았던 거지?","source_cn":"可是，我从没做过这样的事！为什么以前的花瓣茶叶没有苦味？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28DAA3B2C5E25F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321014016:1":{"text":"그건... 제가 매번 꽃잎을 채집한 날 밤 꿀에 절여 두었다 다음 날 아침에 찻잎통에 넣거든요.","source_cn":"我……每次采回花瓣之后，都会将它们浸泡起来，第二天早上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x617D28A1AC63B85F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321014017:1":{"text":"그런데 며칠 전, 장원에 돌아오니 자작님께서 사라진 물감을 찾아오라고 시키셔서 그거 찾느라 그만 까먹고 말았어요...","source_cn":"但是前几天，我刚回到庄园，子爵先生就说有一支颜料不见了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB623C88404F59078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321014018:1":{"text":"...늘 그렇게 해왔던 거군?","source_cn":"……你每次都会做这件事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FAFCC30B471F76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321014019:1":{"text":"네. 이번이 처음으로 까먹은 거예요. 미스터 티포트...","source_cn":"嗯，我只忘过这一次！抱歉，茶壶先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CC87E0EF4B6AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1321014020:1":{"text":"기이한 웨이터가 묵묵하게 정말 많은 일을 해왔던 거군요.","source_cn":"看来奇花默默做了很多工作呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCCE3BFB67999A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1321014021:1":{"text":"역시... 자작님께서 왜 너를 선택하셨는지 알 것 같군.","source_cn":"难怪……我终于理解子爵先生为什么会选中你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE521DA65E98B400E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1321014022:1":{"text":"그게... 무슨 뜻인가요?","source_cn":"这句话……是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85445A323168AC27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1321014023:1":{"text":"그러니까... 크흠, 너도 전혀 쓸모가 없다는 건 아니라는 말이지.","source_cn":"我的意思是——咳，你也不是完全没有可取之处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC3915216DEC2C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1321014023":{"text":"그러니까... 크흠, 너도 전혀 쓸모가 없다는 건 아니라는 말이지.","source_cn":"我的意思是——咳，你也不是完全没有可取之处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC3915216DEC2C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1321014024:1":{"text":"...크흠!","source_cn":"……咳！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF75CBC88F10829CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...크흠!","female":"...크흠!","variant_male_record_index":"147513","variant_female_record_index":"147514","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1321014026:1":{"text":"장원 밖은 위험하니 어서 돌아가시지요. 어디 보자, 시간이...","source_cn":"庄园外并不安全，我们还是尽快返回吧。让我看看时间……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5AEB9964691E1DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1321014027:1":{"text":"이런, 벌써 티타임이군요. 기이한 웨이터, 이제 네 가치를 증명할 시간이야.","source_cn":"哎呀，已经到下午茶时间了。奇花，现在是你体现价值的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6502F130984A2219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1321014028:1":{"text":"아... 제가 다과를 준비하면 되나요?","source_cn":"啊……我来准备茶点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x927A69D9A3A9808D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1321014029:1":{"text":"쓴맛 나는 꽃잎을 꿀에 절여두는 거 잊지 마.","source_cn":"还要记得把苦涩的花瓣拿去蜜渍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19660808CEAF6561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1321014030:1":{"text":"네... 미스터 티포트, 감사합니다!","source_cn":"好的……谢谢您，茶壶先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A343A054868FF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:0:1":{"text":"자신의 실수를 인정한다는 뜻이야","source_cn":"意思是他认识到了自己的错误","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE722CC6024D96B8B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"자신의 실수를 인정한다는 뜻이야","female":"자신의 실수를 인정한다는 뜻이야","variant_male_record_index":"69134","variant_female_record_index":"69135","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1321014025:1":{"text":"아마도요. 하지만 자작님과 손님들 앞에서는 항상 품격을 지키려고 노력합니다.","source_cn":"或许是吧。但是对待子爵先生和尊贵的客人，我一直都很有风度。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDD40FEA734845744","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아마도요. 하지만 자작님과 손님들 앞에서는 항상 품격을 지키려고 노력합니다.","female":"아마도요. 하지만 자작님과 손님들 앞에서는 항상 품격을 지키려고 노력합니다.","variant_male_record_index":"147515","variant_female_record_index":"147516","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:1:2":{"text":"항상 말투가 이래?","source_cn":"你一向说话都是这个风格吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D400CB454551E77","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"항상 말투가 이래?","female":"항상 말투가 이래?","variant_male_record_index":"69136","variant_female_record_index":"69137","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:茶壶先生":{"text":"미스터 티포트","source":"茶壶先生","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奇花侍者":{"text":"기이한 웨이터","source":"奇花侍者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":34,"localized_text_count":33,"speaker_count":4}}